.2 applies. Both reports therefore tighten above the class at which INTPR.7 applies, at the cost of one message each. Because nearly all computational work executes on general-purpose processors, this profile binds widely, and most of its obligations are light at the less severe classes. The type detail that a sub-profile does not hold sits in the hardware annex (STND.ANNEX).
 
